            'Outcomes Over Output Volume',
            'As Melissa Perri and Marty Cagan emphasize: **Features are liabilities until proven to drive customer outcomes**—every button adds future maintenance cost, UI clutter, and user confusion! Great Product Managers measure success NOT by `"How many tickets shipped Friday?"` (`Output`), but `"Did onboarding activation lift from 42% to 60%?"` (`Outcome`). Say no bravely to 80% of random requests so top 20% bets receive genuine craft!',
